DESCRIPTION=Add a fail-closed x86-64 freestanding BIOS boot candidate with long-mode entry, lab identity, concurrent sessions, keyboard, VGA first-cell validation, packaged-lab and portfolio-iframe Chromium tests, and a main-only GitHub Pages deploy of the validated static lab. The guest is not the hosted ELF: filesystem, networking, and server remain unavailable. First-visit iframe isolation uses parent COEP credentialless plus a service worker that injects COEP without COOP on framed documents.
